    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-convert:app:narrative:example-example-meta-convert-schema-to-raw-vault:derive-a-raw-data-vault-design" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-convert:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-convert:app:narrative:guide:working-with-metaconvert">
      <Body>Project a modeled source schema into a raw-vault workspace.

Use a MetaSchema workspace as the source contract, then create the raw-vault design that will carry its source identities and relationships forward.

```powershell
meta-convert schema-to-raw-datavault --source-workspace .\SourceSchema.Workspace --new-workspace .\RawVault.Workspace
```</Body>
