    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-convert:app:narrative:guide:working-with-metaconvert" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-convert:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-convert:app:narrative:summary:summary">
      <Body>`MetaConvert` moves declared structure between sanctioned BI workspaces. It connects source schema to Raw Data Vault, vault or warehouse designs to SQL, quality outputs to SQL assets, and portable analytics to target models.

Each conversion names its source and destination workspaces and applies the rules owned by the target model. The result is a modeled workspace that can be inspected and used by the next CLI.</Body>
